  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-06-28_at_2.29.32_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 207px;\" /></p><p>Let us assume that the side-length of the triangle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>Balancing the torque about point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p>On solving further we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
